{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>The Emim formerly, etc.</b> You might suppose this is the land of the Refa'im that I gave to Abraham, since the Emim — who are Refa'im — formerly dwelt in it. But it is not that one, for those Refa'im I dispossessed before the children of Lot and settled them in their place."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:45:39.426481985Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}